            {
                "uid": "block_1785618174164_3458",
                "type": "paragraf",
                "content": {
                    "html": "<p>Kütlesi 8 kg olan bir cisim sürtünmesiz bir ortamda 15 m/s hızla ilerlemektedir. Bu cisme, hareketine zıt yönde 90 N luk kuvvet uygulanıyor.</p>"
                }
            },
            {
                "uid": "block_1785618174164_801",
                "type": "paragraf",
                "content": {
                    "html": "<div><p></p><p><br></p><div class=\"single-img-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n        <img src=\"../uploads/soru/img_6a6e5eefcfb71.png\" alt=\"Görsel\">\n        <div class=\"img-caption\" contenteditable=\"false\"></div>\n    </div><p><br></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p><b>Buna göre kuvvet cismi kaç m sonra durdurur?</b></p><p></p><p><b></b></p><div class=\"question-options-grid\" contenteditable=\"false\"><div class=\"option-box\"><b>\n                        <span class=\"option-prefix\">A)</span>\n                        <div class=\"option-text\" contenteditable=\"true\">2</div>\n                    </b></div><div class=\"option-box\"><b>\n                        <span class=\"option-prefix\">B)</span>\n                        <div class=\"option-text\" contenteditable=\"true\">4</div>\n                    </b></div><div class=\"option-box\"><b>\n                        <span class=\"option-prefix\">C)</span>\n                        <div class=\"option-text\" contenteditable=\"true\">8</div>\n                    </b></div><div class=\"option-box\"><b>\n                        <span class=\"option-prefix\">D)</span>\n                        <div class=\"option-text\" contenteditable=\"true\">10</div>\n                    </b></div><div class=\"option-box\"><b>\n                        <span class=\"option-prefix\">E)</span>\n                        <div class=\"option-text\" contenteditable=\"true\">15</div>\n                    </b></div></div><p><b><br></b></p><b><br></b><p></p><br><p></p><p><br></p></div>"
                }
            }
        ]
